  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Recall&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>F</mi></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;if and only if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>F</mi></math><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></math></p><p>Taking Option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>T</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>T</mi></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>T</mi></math></p><p>Hence, option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is false.</p><p>Taking Option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>T</mi></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>T</mi></math></p><p>Hence, option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is false.</p><p>Taking Option <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>C</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>F</mi></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>F</mi></math></p><p>Hence, option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>C</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is correct.</p><p>Taking&nbsp;Option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>D</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>F</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>T</mi></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>T</mi></math></p><p>Hence, option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>D</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is false.</p>",
